  "description": "Core abstractions and engine for DotNetBoost.MultiLingual — attribute-driven translatable\n      content for any entity, backed by a single translations store.\n      Includes IMultiLingualManager — the one service application code injects — the store\n      contracts (ITranslationStore, ILanguageStore, ITranslationWriter) for storage providers, and\n      the provider-neutral read (hydrate with default-language fallback) and write paths.",
